# Arabic time-of-day surfaces. Forms confirmed by native speaker
# athmanemokraoui (TigreGotico/chronologia#268). Band boundaries:
# Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale ar (in chronologia/dayparts.py).
# afternoon / after-noon
# NOTE: الظهيرة (midday/noon) is NOT listed here -- it is the noon point (the
# 12:00 clock-landmark in clock_landmark_720.voc), not the afternoon band, so
# listing it here was dead (the noon reading always won).  Only بعد الظهر
# ("after noon") names the [12:00, 18:00) afternoon band.
بعد الظهر
